          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Food Safety request requirements",
          "items": [
            "Facility, process, product, lot, and requested action are defined",
            "Triggering observation, trend, complaint, or change is described",
            "Plan, procedure, control, or specification reference is attached",
            "Sampling, testing, inspection, repair, or review need is identified",
            "Affected product and precautionary hold scope are considered",
            "Qualified food-safety decision owner is assigned",
            "Operations, sanitation, maintenance, and supply-chain impacts are routed",
            "Expected evidence, disposition, and completion due point are defined"
          ]
        },
